  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It appears as an alternating black and white Taiji light sphere with two peculiar Gu worms circling and chasing each other inside.",
        "chapters": [
          194
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After Yin Gu is used, the remaining Yang Gu is white armored.",
        "chapters": [
          202
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_yin_gu",
          "gu_yang_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The pair appears as two peculiar Gu worms circling and chasing each other inside a Taiji light sphere. Fang Yuan notes it is rank four.",
        "chapters": [
          194
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He uses Spring Autumn Cicada’s aura to tame the sealed rank four pair and injects primeval essence to refine it.",
        "chapters": [
          197
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The two worms of the pair are Yin Gu and Yang Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          199
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After use of Yin Gu, only the white armored Yang Gu remains.",
        "chapters": [
          202
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It still counts among his rank four Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          345
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Like Bone Flesh Unity Gu, Yin Yang Rotation Gu is a pair of Gu. Bone Flesh Unity Gu is used on two Gu Masters for dual cultivation; the text groups that pair structure with Yin Yang Rotation Gu when explaining Bone Flesh Unity Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_bone_flesh_unity_gu",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Yin Gu used on a male body turns yang into yin and makes the target a woman. Yang Gu used on a female body turns yin into yang and makes the target a man. Fang Yuan calls Yin Gu a rank four healing Gu with the effect of bringing the dead to life, and states that using it lowers the Gu Master’s aptitude by ten percent. For a ten extreme physique, that drop is not permanent: as cultivation continues, aptitude recovers toward the extreme again, and Yang Gu is then needed to turn the user around and cut aptitude by ten percent once more.",
        "chapters": [
          199
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_healing_gu",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Destroying the pair would leave Bai Ning Bing unable to return to a male body.",
        "chapters": [
          201
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu that saved Bai Ning Bing does not resurrect the Gu worms lost when those worms froze to death.",
        "chapters": [
          200
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "If Yin Gu and Yang Gu are intact and form a complete Taiji light sphere, they feed on the transformation of yin and yang qi and are self-sufficient. With only Yang Gu left, Fang Yuan must release it to absorb yang qi in the air.",
        "chapters": [
          202
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Bai Ning Bing’s Northern Dark Ice Soul Physique is about to finish killing its host after self-explosion of both arms, Fang Yuan activates Yin Gu from the pair and merges it into the ice sculpture. Bai Ning Bing breaks free alive, no longer holding that ten extreme physique, at ninety percent aptitude instead of one hundred. Fang Yuan keeps Yang Gu refined in his aperture and can order it to self-destroy, which is the hold he uses after the crisis.",
        "chapters": [
          199
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_northern_dark_ice_soul_physique"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan cannot use several Gu in northern plains, he leaves yin yang rotation Gu in Hu Immortal blessed land with Blood Skull Gu, Bone Flesh Unity Gu, and other Gu not useful at that moment.",
        "chapters": [
          504
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "storage-and-use-limits",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The yang Gu left after using yin Gu of the yin-yang rotation Gu is still there, beside rank four Blood Skull Gu and rank three Bone Flesh Unity Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          581
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "storage-and-use-limits",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "As an immortal zombie, Fang Yuan notes that yin-yang rotation Gu is only rank four and would not restore his human body.",
        "chapters": [
          653
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "storage-and-use-limits",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
